hments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10745-nosleeves","name":"nosleeves","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-28T20:24:53-07:00","id":1338382,"title":"","content":"As it would happen, I asked this very question in the Exalted Facebook group and Dixie gave me a pretty clear. Per Dixie, as of a couple months ago, the plan is roughly as follows. Obviously this could very well have changed or I could be a complete idiot and misunderstood, so grain of salt.<br /> <br /> They are working on the entirety of both books as we speak. Monthly content will continue to be released up until the entirety of the book is complete, at which point the whole book will drop. So, say, were at 52 HDNP entries currently of a hypothetical 100 total, and the book is three months out. We'll get the next two months of single releases, and then month three well get the whole shebang, all 100 as one complete book. Same with AotR.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-29T00:56:49-07:00","id":1338412,"title":"","content":"Oh, so you mean that they're not going to string out entries every month once they're all done?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-29T21:19:39-07:00","id":1338561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1338044-adversary-collection?p=1338382#post1338382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As it would happen, I asked this very question in the Exalted Facebook group and Dixie gave me a pretty clear. Per Dixie, as of a couple months ago, the plan is roughly as follows. Obviously this could very well have changed or I could be a complete idiot and misunderstood, so grain of salt.<br /> <br /> They are working on the entirety of both books as we speak. Monthly content will continue to be released up until the entirety of the book is complete, at which point the whole book will drop. So, say, were at 52 HDNP entries currently of a hypothetical 100 total, and the book is three months out. We'll get the next two months of single releases, and then month three well get the whole shebang, all 100 as one complete book. Same with AotR.</div> </div> </div> </div>That helpfully clarifies my sense that it's more practical to wait until the whole thing is released rather than buy very many more than what few I have right now, thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-30T23:14:37-07:00","id":1338745,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1338044-adversary-collection?p=1338412#post1338412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, so you mean that they're not going to string out entries every month once they're all done?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I was told.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper o